---
layout: default
---
<div class="post">
  <header class="post-header">
    <h1 class="post-title">
      {% if site.title == 'blank' %}
        <span class="font-weight-bold">{{ site.first_name }}</span> {{ site.middle_name }}
        {{ site.last_name }}
      {% else %}
        {{ site.title }}
      {% endif %}
    </h1>
    <p class="desc">{{ page.subtitle }}</p>
  </header>

  <article>
    {% if page.profile %}
      <div class="profile float-{% if page.profile.align == 'left' %}left{% else %}right{% endif %}">
        {% if page.profile.image %}
          {% assign profile_image_path = page.profile.image | prepend: 'assets/img/' %}
          {% if page.profile.image_circular %}
            {% assign profile_image_class = 'img-fluid z-depth-1 rounded-circle' %}
          {% else %}
            {% assign profile_image_class = 'img-fluid z-depth-1
      rounded' %}
          {% endif %}
          {% capture sizes %}(min-width: {{ site.max_width }}) {{ site.max_width | minus: 30 | times: 0.3}}px, (min-width: 576px)
      30vw, 95vw"{% endcapture %}
          {%
            include figure.liquid loading="eager" path=profile_image_path class=profile_image_class sizes=sizes alt=page.profile.image
            cache_bust=true
          %}
        {% endif %}
        {% if page.profile.more_info %}
          <div class="more-info">{{ page.profile.more_info }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="clearfix">{{ content }}</div>

<!-- 
    <h2>Openings</h2>
    <p>
      I’m looking for self-motivated Ph. D./M. S. students with solid background in programming and interested in computer vision, image processing, and deep learning. I’m also looking for several PostDocs with strong research background in computer vision, image processing, and deep learning, to join my group. Please send me email if you have interest.
    </p> -->


    <!-- News -->
    {% if page.announcements and page.announcements.enabled %}
      <h2>
        <a href="{{ '/news/' | relative_url }}" style="color: inherit">News</a>
      </h2>
      {% include news.liquid limit=true %}
    {% endif %}

    <!-- Latest posts -->
    {% if page.latest_posts and page.latest_posts.enabled %}
      <h2>
        <a href="{{ '/blog/' | relative_url }}" style="color: inherit">latest posts</a>
      </h2>
      {% include latest_posts.liquid %}
    {% endif %}



    <!-- Selected papers -->
    {% if page.selected_papers %}
      <h2>
        <a href="{{ '/publications/' | relative_url }}" style="color: inherit">Selected Publications</a>
      </h2>
      {% include selected_papers.liquid %}
    {% endif %}

    <!-- Social -->
    {% if page.social %}
      <div class="social">
        <div class="contact-icons">{% include social.liquid %}</div>

        <div class="contact-note">{{ site.contact_note }}</div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if site.newsletter and site.newsletter.enabled and site.footer_fixed %}
      {% include newsletter.liquid center=true %}
    {% endif %}


    <h2 class="mt-4">Invited Talk</h2>
    <ul>
      <li> <strong>遥感图像目标检测：从方法演进到智能感知的范式探讨</strong>, <i>第六届图像、视觉和智能系统国际会议 (ICIVIS)</i>, 淮北, 2026.</li>
    <li> <strong>遥感旋转目标检测的发展与大模型时代下的机遇与挑战</strong>, <i>第三届人工智能与遥感科学交叉论坛 (AIRS)</i>, 长沙, 2026.</li>
    <li> <strong>From Modality-Specific to Modality-Universal: Rethinking the Vanishing Boundary in Remote Sensing Object Detection</strong>, <i>Invited Seminar, Faculty of Engineering and Architecture, Ghent University</i>, Ghent, Belgium, 2026.</li>
    <li> <strong>遥感旋转目标检测: 研究进展综述与发展展望</strong>, <i>第二届人工智能遥感应用国际大会 (AIRSA)</i>, 郑州, 2026.</li>
  </ul>



    <h2 class="mt-4">Awards</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>2025 - Chinese Society of Inertial Technology, Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award (中国惯性技术学会优博).</li>
      <li>2024 - Beijing Institute of Technology, Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award (北京理工大学优博论文) .</li>
    </ul>



    <h2 class="mt-4">Academic Service</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Guest Editor for Remote Sensing, IJBT.</li>
      <li>Journal Reviewer for TPAMI, TIP, TMM, TGRS, TCSVT, TII, TITS, IJCV, ISPRS R&S, JAG, PR.</li>
      <li>Conference Reviewer for CVPR, ECCV, ICCV, ICML, NeurIPS, AAAI, ICLR.</li>
    </ul>


    <br>
    <div style="width: 380px; height: 90px; margin: 0 auto;">  
      <script type='text/javascript' id='clustrmaps' src='//cdn.clustrmaps.com/map_v2.js?cl=1f6294&w=a&t=tt&d=QsYwRxkSw7tD_Z207HseBeBR2zeE7dzDIBvYiWNWnCg&co=ffffff&ct=000000&cmo=eb0202&cmn=0fde0f'></script>
    </div>
    <br>
    <br>
    <br>
    <br>
  </article>
</div>
